sequenceDiagram
    actor E as Employee
    participant UI as Web UI
    participant R as Request service
    participant L as Ledger
    actor A as Admin

    E->>UI: picks Dec 23 - Dec 28
    UI->>R: preview(days)
    R-->>UI: 3 days count, Dec 25 holiday + weekend skipped, balance after
    E->>UI: Submit
    UI->>R: create_request
    R->>R: checks: reason, on the policy for every day,<br/>no overlap, partial day not longer than a workday
    R->>L: available balance?
    L-->>R: 64h
    R->>L: HOLD −24h
    R-->>UI: Pending
    A->>UI: Approve, note "Have fun!"
    UI->>R: approve
    R->>R: admin? not their own request? still pending?
    R->>L: HOLD_RELEASE +24h
    R->>L: USAGE −24h
    R-->>UI: Approved (+ event + audit entry)
